{% comment %}
  The "build with Claude Code" call to action, and the two scripts that drive
  it. Self-contained so a page opts in by including it - nothing is loaded on
  pages that do not.
{% endcomment %}

<p class="build-or">or</p>

<button id="bwc-launch" type="button" class="primary-cta bwc-launch" data-umami-event="bwc-deeplink">
  Open in Claude Code
</button>

{% comment %}
  Rendered explicitly by src/build-with-claude.ts with execution "render", so
  nothing is allocated until the button is clicked and the challenge stays out
  of the page unless Turnstile wants an interaction.
{% endcomment %}
<div id="bwc-turnstile" class="bwc-turnstile"></div>

<p id="bwc-error" class="bwc-error" hidden></p>

{% comment %}
  A claude-cli:// navigation reports nothing back - the handler either exists or
  the browser silently does nothing - so this opens either way and says what
  should be happening rather than claiming it worked.
{% endcomment %}
<dialog id="bwc-modal" class="bwc-modal">
  <button id="bwc-close" type="button" class="bwc-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

  <h2 class="bwc-modal-title">Opening Claude Code…</h2>

  <p class="bwc-note">
    If you've got claude code locally, it should have just opened. If it didn't, or you'd prefer to use a different LLM,
    just click the button below and paste the copied prompt into your editor of choice.
  </p>
  <p class="bwc-note">
    Your preview code is <code id="bwc-name" class="bwc-code"></code>, and it will work for the next two hours.
  </p>

  <div class="bwc-copy-row">
    <button id="bwc-copy" type="button" class="bwc-copy" data-umami-event="bwc-copy-command">
      {% comment %} Swapped for the check by .copied on the button. {% endcomment %}
      <svg
        class="bwc-copy-icon"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        width="18"
        height="18"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" />
        <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1" />
      </svg>
      <svg
        class="bwc-copy-check"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        width="18"
        height="18"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
      </svg>
      <span id="bwc-copy-label" class="bwc-copy-label">Copy prompt</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  {% comment %} Announced rather than only shown, since the icon change is visual. {% endcomment %}
  <p id="bwc-copy-status" class="bwc-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</dialog>

<script
  src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?onload=onloadTurnstileCallback&render=explicit"
  async
  defer
></script>
<script type="module" src="/scripts/build-with-claude.js"></script>
